    "excerpt": "Sounds Have Dreams is the audacious third album from Asteroid Ekosystem, the project led by Australian pianist and composer Alister Spence. He has assembled an unlikely quartet that sidesteps genre boundaries: punk and post-punk guitarist Ed Kuepper, The Necks bassist Lloyd Swanton, and drummer Toby Hall. The result feels less like a conventional album and more like eavesdropping on four veterans who no longer feel the need to follow the rules—or apologize for it.",
